## Implementation written after the test

`packages/dsh-tool-mode/src/approval.ts`: `ApprovalStore` + `ApprovalError` with
states pending/approved/denied/committed/expired, lazy TTL on an injected `now`, deterministic
`apr_<16 hex>` ids from request content + injected time, one-shot `commit(id, exactScope)`,
idempotent same-decision `decide`, named refusals (`approval/pending`, `approval/denied`,
`approval/expired`, `approval/already-decided`, `approval/already-committed`,
`approval/scope-mismatch`, `approval/unknown-id`, `approval/invalid-request`,
`approval/invalid-serialization`), fixed-schema records (caller extras dropped, so a token passed by
mistake is never stored), and versioned `toJSON`/`fromJSON` durability.

